---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import WhatsAppFloat from '../components/WhatsAppFloat.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer | DraftToDesign"
  description="DraftToDesign disclaimer: our design and visualization services are not a substitute for licensed architects, engineers, or permit documentation."
>
  <Header slot="header" />
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-900 mb-2">Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">Last updated: September 25, 2026</p>
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-5">
      <p>
        The information and services on drafttodesign.com are provided for general
        design and visualization purposes. Please read the following carefully.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 pt-4">Not professional licensed services</h2>
      <p>
        DraftToDesign is a design and visualization studio, <strong>not a licensed
        architecture or engineering firm</strong>. Our floor plans, drawings, 3D models,
        renders, and design concepts are creative and planning tools. They are not
        stamped plans, structural calculations, or construction documents, and they
        do not satisfy building permit requirements on their own.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 pt-4">Verify before you build</h2>
      <p>
        Always have our deliverables reviewed by qualified local professionals
        (contractor, structural engineer, or licensed architect) and your local
        building authority before starting construction. We are not responsible for
        construction decisions, costs, or outcomes based on our designs.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 pt-4">Portfolio and visuals</h2>
      <p>
        Images in our portfolio include 3D renders and AI-assisted visualizations
        created to demonstrate our capabilities. They represent design concepts,
        not photographs of completed construction.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 pt-4">Pricing and timelines</h2>
      <p>
        Prices shown on this website are starting prices and may change. Delivery
        timelines are estimates. Your written project quote states the exact price
        and timeline for your project.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 pt-4">External links</h2>
      <p>
        Our site links to third-party services such as WhatsApp. We are not
        responsible for the content, privacy practices, or availability of external
        sites.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-900 pt-4">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this disclaimer? Reach us via our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>
        or WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/923044719600">+92 304 4719600</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer slot="footer" />
  <WhatsAppFloat />
</BaseLayout>
